\cf2 You're on foot.  You are in front of a gothic wooden church.  The paint is peeling and the stained glass windows are in disrepair, but it retains much of its beauty and charm especially at this time of year.   Although the colors reached their peak a couple of weeks ago there are still enough orange leaves on the trees to remind you of a New England post card.  On the east side of the church you can make out Alice's garden.  Your VW microbus is parked here on a road heading north.  You'll have to get back in the bus if you want to go that way.  It's too far to walk.  There is a mailbox here.  You are no longer in the bus.\par
