\cf2 You have the garbage.\par
\cf1 \par
east\par
\cf2 You move east.\par
Off to the side of the side road is a 15 foot cliff.  At the botton of the cliff is a little pile of garbage.  You can only move west.\par
\cf1 \par
dump garbage\par
\cf2 The garbage tumbles down the side of the 15 foot cliff with a satisfying clatter.  Mission accomplished.\par
\cf1 \par
put envelope under garbage\par
\cf2 You've put that envelope under that garbage.\par
\cf1 \par
west\par
\cf2 You move west.\par
You are outside the red VW microbus on a side road.  You can walk down a little path to the east or get back in the bus and drive back to the south west.  You can only move east.\par
\cf1 \par
get in bus\par
\cf2 You're back in the red VW microbus.  This is a narrow side road that will soon be too narrow for you to pass.  You can turn around and go back by driving southwest.  Off to the east there seems to be a little footpath.  It can only be visited on foot.\par
\cf1 \par
drive southwest\par
\cf2 You drive southwest.  You are in front of the Town Dump.  There are roads leading northeast, east and south.  The dump is closed on Thanksgiving.\par
